DISCLAIMER
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

This software flashes the SPI EEPROM of a laptop, an operation that can
brick the device if performed incorrectly (wrong firmware written to the
wrong machine, bad clip contact, interrupted write, etc.). The authors and
contributors are not liable for any hardware damage, data loss, or any
other consequence of using this software.

You must own the device you are unlocking and use this tool only on
hardware you have the legal right to modify.
